    "0 always picks the most likely token, which is also the official default. Higher values add randomness, which rarely helps transcription." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0 表示每次都选最有把握的那个词，也是官方默认；调高会引入随机性，对转写任务通常没有好处"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0.9 GB, community quantization. Loads faster and uses less memory (try this first)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
