    "High accuracy (medium)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高精度版 medium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far to expand each layout region when cropping. Cropping tight to the text cuts off stroke edges and the model misses characters. Corresponds to the official unclip_ratio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裁剪每个版面区域时向外扩张的比例。贴着文字裁会切掉笔画边缘，模型因此漏字；对应官方的 unclip_ratio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How files are separated when several are exported into one text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多个文件导出为同一文本时，各文件内容之间的分隔方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the same file (judged by content, regardless of name or location) was recognized with the same settings, the earlier result is reused. “Recognize Again” always reads afresh. The list and results are kept after quitting and are there next time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一个文件（按内容判断，与文件名和位置无关）用同样的设置识别过，就直接复用上次的结果。「重新识别」总是重新读取。列表和识别结果在退出后保留，下次打开继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image Preprocessing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图像预处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image decoding runs truly in parallel. PaddleOCR inference still runs one image at a time (so multiple model copies don't fight over the CPU), but the next image's decoding no longer waits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片解码会真正并行；PaddleOCR 的模型推理仍逐张进行（避免多份模型抢占同一颗 CPU），但下一张的解码不再等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Images go into an .assets folder named after the .md file and are referenced by relative path. When off, image positions keep only an empty placeholder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片写入与 .md 同名的 .assets 文件夹，文档中以相对路径引用；关闭后图片位置只保留空的占位符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include file names when exporting" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导出时包含文件名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Includes subfolders. Files are read once they finish writing; originals are never moved or deleted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包括子文件夹。文件写入完成后才会读取，原文件不会被移动或删除"
