            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "采用当前结果，转到下一处（⌘↩）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps each page as it looks (PDF pages stay vector, not re-rasterized) and lays the recognized text over it as an invisible layer, so it can be searched and copied in Preview, Spotlight and elsewhere. Pages that already have a text layer are left alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留原页面外观（PDF 原页面以矢量形式保留，不重新栅格化），把识别文字以不可见文字层叠在原位置上，可在预览、聚焦等程序里搜索和复制。原本就有文字层的页面不重复添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps heading levels, image positions and tables. Only results with layout analysis have this structure (PaddleOCR-VL, or PP-OCRv6 with layout analysis on); others fall back to plain text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留标题层级、图片位置与表格。只有做过版面分析的结果才有这些结构（PaddleOCR-VL，或开启了版面分析的 PP-OCRv6）；没有的会退回纯文本。"
