          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a file is recognized, it is written to the output folder in the format chosen under Text & Export, keeping the subfolder structure. Source files whose output already exists count as done and aren't recognized again. Without an output folder, results stay in the list only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个文件识别完成后，按「文本与导出」里选择的格式写入输出文件夹，并保留子文件夹结构；输出文件已存在的源文件视为已处理，不会重复识别。不选输出文件夹时，结果只留在列表里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only affects how the Markdown tab displays; the Source tab always shows the model's raw output. Other engines produce plain text and are not affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅影响「Markdown」标签页的显示方式；「源码」标签页始终是模型输出的原文。其它引擎只有纯文本，不受这里影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only applies when temperature is above 0: samples from the candidates whose cumulative probability reaches this value" : {
      "localizations" : {
