    "Regions from the same page, neighboring pages and neighboring files are decoded together on the GPU. Each region's crop, prompt and decoding are unchanged, so results match one-at-a-time reading, only faster. Each extra lane uses about 45 MB more memory." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一页、相邻页面和相邻文件的多个区域在 GPU 上一起解码。每个区域的裁剪、提示词和解码方式都不变，识别结果与逐块识别一致，只是更快。每多一路约多占 45 MB 内存。"
