    "Text & Export" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本与导出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Boxes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字框"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Detection & Recognition" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本检测与识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text detection only gives each line's position, not its order. Layout analysis uses PP-DocLayoutV3 to find columns, headings, figures and other regions and decide the reading order, then places lines back into their regions — as PaddleOCR's official document parsing does. Results also gain heading levels and image positions, ready to export as Markdown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本检测只给出每一行的位置，不给出先后。版面分析用 PP-DocLayoutV3 找出页面上的栏目、标题、图表等区域并判定阅读顺序，再把文字行放回区域里——这也是 PaddleOCR 官方文档解析的做法，同时让结果带上标题层级、图片位置，可直接导出 Markdown。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text in a native PDF is already exact, so using it directly is fastest and most accurate. Hidden OCR layers that other software added to scans are of unknown quality, so those pages are recognized again by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原生 PDF 的文字本身就是准确的，直接取用最快也最准；扫描件上由其他软件生成的隐藏 OCR 文字层质量未知，默认会重新识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text in images" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片文字识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text line orientation correction" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本行方向校正"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text post-processing only affects new results; existing ones are not changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本后处理仅影响新识别的结果，不会修改已有内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text recognition" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text spotting" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字定位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thai" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "泰语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PDF text layer has no text here; reading the image with PP-OCRv6 instead" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PDF 文字层在此区域没有文字，改用 PP-OCRv6 识别图像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PP-DocLayoutV3 layout model isn't downloaded yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尚未下载 PP-DocLayoutV3 版面模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PaddleOCR dictionary file is missing, so results can't be decoded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缺少 PaddleOCR 字典文件，无法解码识别结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PaddleOCR model isn't loaded" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PaddleOCR 模型未加载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PaddleOCR-VL model isn't loaded" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PaddleOCR-VL 模型未加载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The context must fit one block's visual tokens plus its output. The per-block output limit keeps one block from stalling the whole page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上下文要装得下一块图像的视觉 token 加上它的输出；单块输出上限防止某一块卡住整页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The detection probability map is incomplete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检测概率图数据不足"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first stage of PaddleOCR-VL: splits the layout and decides the reading order. Required for the VL engine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PaddleOCR-VL 的第一阶段：切分版面并判定阅读顺序。使用 VL 引擎必装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image's long side is scaled to this size before detection. Raise it for dense small text, at the cost of speed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片长边会缩放到该尺寸再送入检测模型。密集小字可调高，速度随之下降。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layout model PP-DocLayoutV3.onnx is missing. Download it in Model Manager, or put the file in %@ and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缺少版面分析模型 PP-DocLayoutV3.onnx。请在「模型管理」中下载，或将文件放入 %@ 后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layout model isn't installed, so this page was read with PP-OCRv6 only, without per-region routing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未安装版面分析模型，本页只用 PP-OCRv6 识别，未做分区路由"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layout model returned no detections" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版面模型未返回检测结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model has no vocabulary" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
