            "value" : "精度最高的一档，检测与识别均优于 small；共享内置字典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official PaddleOCR pipeline: split the layout, decide the reading order, prompt each block appropriately, then assemble Markdown. When off, the whole page goes to the model at once — much faster, but content gets missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PaddleOCR 官方管线：切分版面、判定阅读顺序，逐块选用合适的提示词，最后拼成 Markdown。关闭后整页一次性交给模型，快得多但会漏内容。"
          }
