          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These regions are always recognized and always drawn in the preview (filtered ones with dashed boxes); this only decides whether they go into the text and Markdown. Changes apply immediately without recognizing again — except for multi-page PDFs, whose text is assembled page by page during recognition." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
