          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes, page by page, each line's text, four-point coordinates and confidence, plus each layout region's type, reading order, position, which engine read it and why it needs review — for further processing by other programs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
